    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What kind of game is this?</strong><br><strong>A:</strong> It\u2019s a 3D game where you bounce on a Pogo Stick and try to climb a massive tower full of tricky obstacles. Mess up a jump, and you\u2019re flying back down to the bottom. Yeah, it\u2019s brutal, but that\u2019s what makes it so addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/f006ea31414fba3ef7e24b68a405b60b.avif?t=1737980817\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.poster.avif?t=1737980817\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.webm?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.mp4?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game throws all kinds of wild stuff at you\u2014springy platforms, moving traps, and unpredictable challenges. Each section is different, keeping you on edge and making every jump feel like a mini-adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.poster.avif?t=1737980817\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.webm?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.mp4?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there are moments where it\u2019s just you, your Pogo Stick, and the cliffs. Use the environment to pull off tricks, find shortcuts, or blaze your own trail to the top. The freedom to experiment makes every climb feel personal and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got the skill and patience to reach the top?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What kind of game is this?</strong><br><strong>A:</strong> It\u2019s a 3D game where you bounce on a Pogo Stick and try to climb a massive tower full of tricky obstacles. Mess up a jump, and you\u2019re flying back down to the bottom. Yeah, it\u2019s brutal, but that\u2019s what makes it so addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/f006ea31414fba3ef7e24b68a405b60b.avif?t=1737980817\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.poster.avif?t=1737980817\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.webm?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/363afc8cc576fee7d086fd3c64bf5127.mp4?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game throws all kinds of wild stuff at you\u2014springy platforms, moving traps, and unpredictable challenges. Each section is different, keeping you on edge and making every jump feel like a mini-adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.poster.avif?t=1737980817\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.webm?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409720/extras/3518f31b0a71bde159b75ca0f6df219a.mp4?t=1737980817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there are moments where it\u2019s just you, your Pogo Stick, and the cliffs. Use the environment to pull off tricks, find shortcuts, or blaze your own trail to the top. The freedom to experiment makes every climb feel personal and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got the skill and patience to reach the top?</p>",
    "short_description": "Real gamer? Prove it. Take on the impossible challenge\u2014one unlucky slip, and you\u2019re back at the bottom. Be among the first to reach the top. Pure focus solo or chaotic fun with friends \u2014 regret? Not a chance.",
